menu "WiFi Dap SSDP (UPnP discovery)"

    config BIRDIEBOT_SSDP_ENABLE
        bool "Enable the SSDP service (UDP 1900 + /SSDP.xml description)"
        default n
        help
            Slim build (H1, 2026-10-26): the SSDP responder is disabled
            because UPnP discovery is no longer part of the product.  When
            disabled, components/SSDP/ssdp.c compiles to an empty translation
            unit, wifi_manager no longer starts the service, the WiFi
            IP-event handler no longer feeds it the station IP/gateway and
            the embedded Web UI no longer serves /SSDP.xml.

            The source and the public API stay in the tree so a full-feature
            image can be restored with one Kconfig line
            (docs/feature-flags.md H1).  mDNS (wt_mdns) is independent and
            stays enabled.
endmenu
